<title>INDONESIA: TABLE-Jembo Cable H1 net soars.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Jembo Cable H1 net soars.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			 (in billion rupiah except per share)</p>
<p>    Sales			    73.53	   vs    108.32</p>
<p>    Net income			4.03	   vs	1.33</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)  52	    vs	18</p>
<p>    Gross profit		   10.86	   vs     11.40</p>
<p>    Income from operations	5.13	   vs	3.38</p>
<p>    Other income		    0.03	   vs     (1.72)</p>
<p>Note: The results were unaudited. PT Jembo Cable Co Tbk manufactures electricity and telecommunications cables.</p>
